Who was it? Who said that was lame?

00:16:19.080 --> 00:16:21.250
Sasazuka, go stand over there.

00:16:21.250 --> 00:16:22.160
You're all dismissed.

00:16:22.160 --> 00:16:23.580
Let's go!

00:16:24.960 --> 00:16:26.670
Wait for me!

00:16:26.670 --> 00:16:28.340
Let's go!

00:16:28.340 --> 00:16:30.130
Hey, Micchan!

00:16:30.130 --> 00:16:31.970
What are we going to do?

00:16:31.970 --> 00:16:34.340
Draw? Copy a map?

00:16:34.640 --> 00:16:36.680
Both sound good. Let's do them!

00:16:41.520 --> 00:16:43.060
No, no, you can't.

00:16:43.480 --> 00:16:47.360
The scenery's beautiful. Let's draw it!

00:16:47.360 --> 00:16:49.780
You think so? Me too.

00:16:49.780 --> 00:16:51.110
What do you think, Matsuri-chan?

00:16:52.070 --> 00:16:53.740
Okay. Sounds good.

00:16:54.200 --> 00:16:55.450
All right, it's decided!

00:16:55.450 --> 00:16:56.740
How about you, Micchan?

00:16:58.700 --> 00:17:01.160
I didn't bring any paint.

00:17:01.160 --> 00:17:03.660
Huh? Then what should we do?

00:17:05.290 --> 00:17:07.170
I'll call Nobue onee-chan!

00:17:07.750 --> 00:17:11.590
Um, we're not allowed to use cell phones during class.

00:17:22.520 --> 00:17:24.480
Matsuoka Miu
Incoming Call

00:17:31.780 --> 00:17:34.240
What is it? You're such a pain.

00:17:34.990 --> 00:17:37.240
Huh? You forgot your paint box?

00:17:37.240 --> 00:17:38.990
I don't care about that.

00:17:38.990 --> 00:17:39.870
Huh?

00:17:40.700 --> 00:17:42.540
Where's my paint?

00:17:43.290 --> 00:17:45.830
There's no white! Why?

00:17:45.830 --> 00:17:47.210
What's going on?

00:17:47.830 --> 00:17:50.500
I can't do anything without white.

00:17:50.500 --> 00:17:53.170
So, my paint is...

00:17:56.510 --> 00:17:58.260
...under the bed?

00:18:05.730 --> 00:18:07.690
That little punk...

00:18:21.160 --> 00:18:23.370
Yo! I've been waiting, Onee-chan!

00:18:23.370 --> 00:18:26.160
You're so noisy! Where are you now?

00:18:27.710 --> 00:18:30.540
Huh? Near a cosplaying samurai?

00:18:30.540 --> 00:18:32.880
What the hell do you mean by that?

00:18:49.850 --> 00:18:52.810
Well done. You followed directions well, considering you're an idiot.

00:18:52.810 --> 00:18:54.690
Wow, Onee-chan came!

00:18:54.690 --> 00:18:55.690
And now, beat up that samurai, or else...
Wow, Onee-chan came!

00:18:55.690 --> 00:18:57.570
Is this all right?
And now, beat up that samurai, or else...

00:18:57.570 --> 00:18:59.150
She's really getting into this role.

00:19:02.780 --> 00:19:05.830
Wait! That was a joke! You don't have to fight it!

00:19:05.830 --> 00:19:06.790
Let's be pen pals!

00:19:11.330 --> 00:19:12.790
Wait!

00:19:16.760 --> 00:19:20.680
If you want these, hand over Matsuri-chan and Ana-chan.

00:19:20.680 --> 00:19:24.810
What?! You heartless fiend!

00:19:26.560 --> 00:19:27.930
Yes? This is Matsuoka.

00:19:27.930 --> 00:19:32.100
You know, if this goes on, you'll end up as the kidnapper.

00:19:34.650 --> 00:19:36.650
Give me the money first!

00:19:36.650 --> 00:19:38.400
Where did I go wrong?

00:19:38.400 --> 00:19:40.360
Ah, wait, Onee-chan!
Seriously, where?

00:19:44.910 --> 00:19:46.160
What is it?

00:19:46.160 --> 00:19:49.540
Onee-chan, come quickly! Matsuri-chan is in big trouble!

00:19:49.540 --> 00:19:50.540
Matsuri-chan?!

00:19:50.540 --> 00:19:52.000
Trouble!

00:19:52.000 --> 00:19:52.170
Dangerous
Shortcut
Trouble!

00:19:52.170 --> 00:19:52.290
Dangerous
Shortcut

00:19:52.290 --> 00:19:53.670
Trouble!
Dangerous
Shortcut

00:19:53.670 --> 00:19:55.000
Matsuri-chan!

00:19:55.000 --> 00:19:58.260
She's in trouble...

00:19:58.260 --> 00:20:00.880
...because she climbed all the way up here!

00:20:05.100 --> 00:20:06.300
You bastard...

00:20:06.300 --> 00:20:08.890
Huh? Are you mad?

00:20:09.560 --> 00:20:12.140
Matsuri-chan, apologize to Onee-chan.

00:20:15.110 --> 00:20:15.770
Facial

00:20:25.200 --> 00:20:28.660
What fresh air...

00:20:28.990 --> 00:20:32.870
Full of negative ions...

00:20:33.580 --> 00:20:37.500
All right, now that we've rested up, what should we draw?

00:20:37.500 --> 00:20:40.550
Uh... um...

00:20:40.920 --> 00:20:42.420
How about one of the gardens?

00:20:42.420 --> 00:20:43.680
The Japanese garden!

00:20:43.680 --> 00:20:46.050
I窶的sn't that a bit boring?

00:20:46.050 --> 00:20:47.550
I guess it is kind of plain.

00:20:47.550 --> 00:20:48.680
How about the castle?

00:20:48.680 --> 00:20:50.520
Then we can draw the castle walls!

00:20:50.520 --> 00:20:56.350
The stone walls around here were built using stones that look unstable,

00:20:56.350 --> 00:21:00.110
yet they're durable and can withstand several hundred years of wear!

00:21:00.110 --> 00:21:02.440
The builders must've had great skills!

00:21:02.940 --> 00:21:04.910
People say that they look pretty normal,

00:21:04.910 --> 00:21:08.490
but in my opinion, the walls are interesting
because of the techniques used to make them.

00:21:08.870 --> 00:21:11.580
Ana-chan wants to draw the walls, right?

00:21:11.580 --> 00:21:13.000
Let's draw them, then.

00:21:13.000 --> 00:21:16.080
N窶哲o, we can draw them some other time.

00:21:16.080 --> 00:21:18.960
It's okay. You don't have to say that for our sake.

00:21:24.880 --> 00:21:26.760
It's so pretty!

00:21:26.760 --> 00:21:28.430
So elegant!

00:21:28.430 --> 00:21:29.930
I'll draw here!

00:21:29.930 --> 00:21:31.350
Then, I'll...

00:21:33.430 --> 00:21:36.060
You fell! Yay!

00:21:36.810 --> 00:21:38.860
I'll draw from here!

00:22:01.800 --> 00:22:03.760
Ana-chan! Ana-chan!

00:22:03.760 --> 00:22:05.050
Look! Look!

00:22:06.010 --> 00:22:08.180
What is this? It makes no sense!

00:22:08.180 --> 00:22:09.390
It's funny!

00:22:19.060 --> 00:22:21.270
P窶撤lease don't move.

00:22:25.440 --> 00:22:26.990
It's a bit embarrassing.

00:22:35.830 --> 00:22:37.790
Neither breathing,

00:22:37.790 --> 00:22:40.080
nor moving,

00:22:40.080 --> 00:22:41.840
is this what it means to be a model?

00:22:42.340 --> 00:22:43.460
By Akifumi

00:22:44.800 --> 00:22:47.090
What did you draw that made her angry?

00:22:47.090 --> 00:22:48.340
Nothing...

00:22:48.760 --> 00:22:50.430
I'll draw you now.

00:22:51.140 --> 00:22:54.060
Don't! Just draw the scenery.

00:23:02.940 --> 00:23:04.320
Geez! You're bothering me!

00:23:04.320 --> 00:23:05.360
Done!
Geez! You're bothering me!

00:23:05.360 --> 00:23:06.900
Huh? Let me see!

00:23:10.860 --> 00:23:14.330
What the heck are you drawing? Hey! Wait!

00:23:15.370 --> 00:23:20.250
Everyone, please return to the meeting spot.

00:23:20.250 --> 00:23:22.830
Sasazuka, you don't have to hurry.

00:23:22.830 --> 00:23:24.460
Why not?

00:23:25.800 --> 00:23:27.960
We'll have to finish the drawings when we get home.

00:23:27.960 --> 00:23:28.760
Yeah!

00:23:28.760 --> 00:23:30.430
What did you guys draw?

00:23:30.430 --> 00:23:31.800
Let's show each other our pictures.

00:23:31.800 --> 00:23:33.430
Ah, good idea.

00:23:33.430 --> 00:23:35.390
Flowers and a butterfly.

00:23:35.390 --> 00:23:37.100
That's just like you, Matsuri-chan.

00:23:37.100 --> 00:23:39.680
Yep, yep. It's really cute.

00:23:41.310 --> 00:23:43.230
Chika-chan, you're so good!

00:23:43.230 --> 00:23:47.980
The single person sitting on the left gives off a feeling of sadness.

00:23:49.030 --> 00:23:50.570
How about Ana-chan's?

00:23:50.570 --> 00:23:52.990
Wow, it's kind of cool!

00:23:52.990 --> 00:23:56.200
No, I still have a lot to learn!

00:23:56.200 --> 00:23:57.790
How about you, Micchan?

00:23:57.790 --> 00:24:00.210
Behold my masterpiece!

00:24:00.210 --> 00:24:02.540
The clock tower control panel.

00:24:02.540 --> 00:24:05.170
It's quite accurate.

00:24:05.170 --> 00:24:07.960
But why did you draw that?

00:24:09.170 --> 00:24:10.920
I forgot to eat my snacks!

00:24:10.920 --> 00:24:13.220
That's because you kept doing stupid stuff.

00:24:13.220 --> 00:24:16.010
I didn't finish my snacks either.

00:24:16.010 --> 00:24:19.100
Then, let's trade, Matsuri-chan.

00:24:19.100 --> 00:24:20.890
Huh? Okay.

00:24:23.810 --> 00:24:25.110
Sashimi?

00:24:25.110 --> 00:24:27.520
And she got it from an expiration sale.

00:24:27.520 --> 00:24:28.530
Let's go!

00:24:28.530 --> 00:24:31.400
What's wrong? It was 680 yen!

00:24:31.400 --> 00:24:33.320
That's over 300 yen!

00:24:33.320 --> 00:24:35.660
It got reduced to 200 yen at the end of the expiration sale!

00:24:35.660 --> 00:24:37.490
Then you should eat it yourself!

00:24:37.490 --> 00:24:40.500
I don't want it. It's gone bad.

