owaranai owarinai
Never-ending, it never ends

00:25:10.110 --> 00:25:16.070
kokyuu no rifurein
The refrain of my breath

00:25:17.740 --> 00:25:24.040
suikomu hakidasu
Inhaling, exhaling

00:25:25.580 --> 00:25:33.090
karappo nanka kimochi ii
